'''Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)''' (花火職人, ''Hanabi Shokunin'', '''Fireworks Craftsmen''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Those Guys]] that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)
|image = E 106.png
|appearance = [[Special Events|Event Stages]]
|money drop = 1¢ - 4¢
}}

==Enemy==
They have slow movement speed, extremely low health and many similarities to [[Those Guys]]. Due to them not attacking, this enemy will never deal any damage; they simply sit in front of their target and never stop shooting fireworks.

==Strategy==
This enemy doesn't attack and has the lowest health possible. Nearly anything can kill them, so either use them to the benefit of [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] or just ignore them outright.

